### ❌错误标注（序号）
1. a Chinese ancient folk art → 形容词顺序错误：ancient Chinese
2. the kite were → 主谓不一致，改为 kites were
3. imformations → 不可数名词，无复数，改为 messages
4. become → 时态错误，和 later 呼应改为 became
5. relax toy → 修饰名词用形容词 relaxing
6. on spring → 介词错误，季节前用 in spring
7. a outdoor activities → outdoor 元音开头用 an；activities 改为单数 activity
8. as well as embodies → 结构错误，not only...but also 更适合本句递进


